# Copy to `.dev.vars` (same folder) — that file is gitignored.
# Wrangler loads these for `pnpm dev` / `wrangler dev` in apps/worker.
#
# Weather uses Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com/) — no key required.
#
# Optional — AI routes:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
#
# Optional — Sarvam AI voice stack (STT / TTS / translate):
# SARVAM_API_KEY=
#
# Optional — BFF to R Plumber (see apps/analytics-r/README.md):
# ANALYTICS_R_URL=
# ANALYTICS_R_TOKEN=
